  "cited_article_id": "create-custom-lab-panels",
  "reply": "Only clinical administrators can build shared lab panels. Go to Clinical Setup > Lab Management > Order Panels, click **Create New Panel**, enter a panel name and specialty, add tests via the search bar (max 25 tests), then **Save and Publish**. To make the panel visible to providers, ensure its sharing permissions are set for their department under Settings > Permissions > Lab Access."
}
